sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API
    participant SS as SubscriptionService
    participant PC as ProrationCalculator
    participant CS as CurrencyService
    participant PPS as PaymentProcessingService
    participant DB as Database
    participant ALS as AuditLogService
    participant EB as EventBus

    Note over User,API: User wants to upgrade<br/>from Creator ($9/mo) to Pro ($29/mo)

    User->>API: POST /subscriptions/:id/upgrade
    API->>SS: upgradeSubscription(id, newPlanId)

    SS->>DB: Get subscription details
    DB-->>SS: Current subscription

    SS->>SS: Validate upgrade allowed

    alt Valid upgrade
        SS->>DB: Get plan details (current & new)
        DB-->>SS: Plan information

        SS->>PC: calculateProration(currentPlan, newPlan, daysRemaining)

        Note over PC: Proration calculation:<br/>Unused credit = ($9/30) * 15 days = $4.50<br/>New plan cost = $29/30 * 15 days = $14.50<br/>Amount due = $14.50 - $4.50 = $10.00

        PC->>CS: convertToUserCurrency(prorationAmount)
        CS-->>PC: Converted amount
        PC-->>SS: ProrationResult

        alt Proration amount > 0 (upgrade)
            SS->>PPS: createInvoice(prorationAmount)
            PPS-->>SS: Invoice created

            SS->>PPS: processPayment(invoice)

            alt Payment successful
                PPS-->>SS: PaymentResult (success)

                SS->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
                SS->>DB: Update subscription.planId = newPlanId
                SS->>DB: Update subscription.price = newPrice
                SS->>DB: Update subscription.features = newFeatures
                SS->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

                SS->>ALS: Log upgrade success
                SS->>EB: Emit 'subscription.upgraded'
                SS->>EB: Emit 'subscription.plan_changed'

                SS->>SS: updateAnalytics(MRR, upgradeLTV)

                SS-->>API: Upgrade successful
                API-->>User: 200 OK + new subscription

            else Payment failed
                PPS-->>SS: PaymentResult (failed)
                SS->>ALS: Log upgrade payment failure
                SS-->>API: Payment failed error
                API-->>User: 402 Payment Required
                Note over User: Subscription remains<br/>on current plan
            end

        else Proration amount < 0 (downgrade)
            Note over SS: Credit remaining time<br/>Apply to next billing cycle

            SS->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
            SS->>DB: subscription.pendingPlanChange = newPlanId
            SS->>DB: subscription.creditBalance = abs(prorationAmount)
            SS->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

            Note over SS: Downgrade effective<br/>at end of current period

            SS->>ALS: Log scheduled downgrade
            SS->>EB: Emit 'subscription.downgrade_scheduled'

            SS-->>API: Downgrade scheduled
            API-->>User: 200 OK + pending change info

        else Proration amount = 0
            SS->>DB: Update subscription immediately
            SS->>EB: Emit 'subscription.plan_changed'
            SS-->>API: Plan changed
            API-->>User: 200 OK
        end

    else Invalid upgrade
        SS-->>API: Validation error
        API-->>User: 400 Bad Request
        Note over User: E.g., downgrade to same plan,<br/>incompatible plan change
    end

    Note over SS,EB: All operations are atomic<br/>and fully audited
